# Loan Book, Schedule & Member Ledger

Screens: **Loan Book** (`/lms/loan-book`), loan account drawer, repayment schedule tab, member ledger.

Tables: `mst_loan_account`, `trans_loanac_schedule`, `trans_loan_collection`, `mst_loan_account_disbursement`.

| Endpoint | Method | Procedure |
|----------|--------|-----------|
| `/api/LoanBookList` | `GET` | `USP_LOAN_BOOK_LIST` |
| `/api/LoanAccountGet` | `GET` | `USP_LOAN_BOOK_LIST` (one row) + schedule, collections, disbursements, adjustments, charges, guarantors, mortgages, freezes |
| `/api/LoanScheduleList` | `GET` | `USP_LOAN_SCHEDULE_LIST` |
| `/api/LoanMemberLedger` | `GET` | `USP_LOAN_MEMBER_LEDGER` |

> The design calls the book list `LoanAccountList`; that name is already taken by the existing loan-account master API (`/api/LoanAccountList`, unchanged), so the book is `/api/LoanBookList`.

### Computed values (all "as on" `as_on_date`, default today)

| Value | Meaning |
|-------|---------|
| `principal_outstanding` | Disbursed − principal collected − principal waived (+ capitalized interest) |
| `overdue_principal` / `overdue_interest` | Unpaid scheduled amounts with due date before the as-on date |
| `principal_due` / `interest_due` | Overdue + the installment due on the as-on date |
| `penalty_due` | Scheme penalty on overdue installments − penalty already collected / waived |
| `dpd` | Days past due of the oldest unpaid installment (0 when nothing overdue) |
| `bucket` | `current` (DPD 0), `par` (DPD ≥ 1, below the scheme's NPA days), `npa` (DPD ≥ scheme NPA days, or marked NPA), `closed` (closed / written off) |
| `is_defaulter` / `is_npa` | Manual flags (see [08](08_LoanMonitoring.md)) |

