## 1. LoanBookList

```
GET /api/LoanBookList?bucket=par&page=1&per_page=20
```

| Query | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| `loan_account_id`, `branch_id`, `group_id`, `center_id`, `scheme_id`, `fo_id`, `member_id` | int | |
| `ln_status_cd` | int | Group 40: 1 Active, 2 Closed, 3 Written Off |
| `bucket` | string | `current`, `par`, `npa`, `closed`, or a DPD range `par_1_30`, `par_31_60`, `par_61_90`, `npa_90_plus` |
| `is_defaulter`, `is_npa` | bool | |
| `as_on_date` | date | Default today |
| `keyword` / `search` | string | Loan account no, application no, member / group name, mobile |
| `page` / `per_page` | int | |

