## 2. LoanAccountGet

```
GET /api/LoanAccountGet?loan_account_id=9&as_on_date=2026-10-28
```

`data` = the book row above plus:

| Key | Content |
|-----|---------|
| `schedule` | `LoanScheduleList` rows |
| `collections` | `LoanCollectionList` items of this loan (see [06](06_LoanCollection.md)) |
| `disbursements` | `LoanDisbursementList` items (see [04](04_LoanDisbursement.md)) |
| `adjustments` | `LoanAdjustmentList` items (see [07](07_LoanAdjustmentClosure.md)) |
| `charges`, `guarantors`, `mortgages`, `deposit_freezes` | Child lists of the application (see [02](02_LoanApplicationChildren.md)) |

`404` *Loan account not found*.

