## 3. LoanScheduleList

```
GET /api/LoanScheduleList?loan_account_id=9
```

| Query | Type | Required |
|-------|------|----------|
| `loan_account_id` | int | Yes |
| `as_on_date` | date | No (decides Due / Overdue) |

Paid amounts are allocated FIFO from approved collections.

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Repayment schedule retrieved successfully",
  "data": [
    {
      "schedule_id": 101, "loan_account_id": 9, "installment_no": 1, "due_date": "2026-11-28",
      "principal_due": 2913.84, "interest_due": 570, "total_due": 3483.84,
      "principal_waived": 0, "interest_waived": 0, "advance_paid": 3483.84,
      "principal_paid": 2913.84, "interest_paid": 570, "paid_amount": 3483.84, "balance_due": 0,
      "outs_principal": 35086.16, "collection_id": 41, "collection_trans_no": "LC-0000003",
      "status": "Paid"
    }
  ]
}
```

`status`: `Paid`, `Partly Paid`, `Due` (first unpaid on / after the as-on date), `Overdue` (before the as-on date), `Upcoming`, `Closed` (unpaid rows of a closed / written-off loan).

