## 4. LoanMemberLedger

Principal statement of a loan account, or of every loan of a member (as borrower, joint applicant or group member).

```
GET /api/LoanMemberLedger?member_id=9046&from_date=2026-10-01&to_date=2026-10-31
```

| Query | Type | Required | Description |
|-------|------|----------|-------------|
| `loan_account_id` | int | One of the two | |
| `member_id` | int | One of the two | |
| `from_date` / `to_date` | date | No | Entries before `from_date` form the opening balance |

- **Debit**: approved disbursement (gross) and capitalized interest. **Credit**: principal collected and principal waived.
- `interest`, `penalty`, `total` are informational (amounts collected / waived on that entry).
- `balance` = running principal balance (`opening_balance` + debit − credit).

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Member ledger retrieved successfully",
  "data": {
    "opening_balance": 0,
    "entries": [
      { "date": "2026-10-28", "entry_date": "2026-10-28", "loan_account_id": 9, "loan_account_no": "LN-2026-00005", "entry_type": "disbursement", "ref_no": "DB-000001", "voucher_id": null, "voucher_no": null, "narration": "Loan disbursement", "debit": 20000, "credit": 0, "interest": 0, "penalty": 0, "total": 20000, "balance": 20000 },
      { "date": "2026-10-28", "entry_date": "2026-10-28", "loan_account_id": 9, "loan_account_no": "LN-2026-00005", "entry_type": "collection", "ref_no": "LC-0000003", "voucher_id": 33, "voucher_no": "RV-2026-00002", "narration": "Advance collection", "debit": 0, "credit": 2913.84, "interest": 570, "penalty": 0, "total": 3483.84, "balance": 17086.16 }
    ],
    "closing_balance": 17086.16
  }
}
```

`entry_type`: `disbursement`, `collection`, `adjustment`.

