## Errors

| HTTP | When |
|------|------|
| `401` | Unauthorized |
| `404` | Loan account not found (Get / Schedule) |
| `422` | Missing `loan_account_id` (Get / Schedule) or both `loan_account_id` and `member_id` (Ledger); `to_date` before `from_date` |

